    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\n29 Harbour View is a three bedroom mid terrace house, excellently located in a beautiful waterfront setting on the Wild Atlantic Way, overlooking Clew Bay.\n\nThe floor area extends to approximately 122.5 sq m (1,319 sq ft). Ground floor accommodation comprises of an entrance porch which opens up into a spacious entrance hall, living room, kitchen and WC. The first floor comprises of three double bedrooms (one en-suite and built in wardrobes) and a family bathroom. On the second floor, there is a large room with a shower room which can be utilised as playroom, a second living room or further living space, subject to a purchasers requirements. \n\nExternally, the property features a low-maintenance, walled rear courtyard with gate access. \n\nThis residence benefits from its proximity to a wide choice of amenities, including The Quay National School, numerous restaurants and bars, Westport House and Gardens, a number of hotels with leisure and spa facilities, The Point swimming area and a selection of shops including a supermarket. A number of Blue Fag beaches are located within a short drive.\n\nThis would make a perfect home for numerous types of buyers, including first time buyers, family home, someone wishing to downsize close to amenities, as an easily maintained holiday home in one of the West of Ireland's most popular destinations or someone looking for an investment property. \n\nOFFERS IN EXCESS OF 369,000"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Porch - 1.32m x 1.2m\nTiled floor\n\nEntrance Hall - 1.27m x 1.17m & 2.3m x 1.0 & 2.1m x 1.45m\nOak laminate floor, under stair storage\n\nLiving Room - 6.1m x 2.5m & 2.5m x 1.9m\nOak laminate floor, open fireplace, sea views\n\nKitchen - 5.3m x 3.3m\nLino flooring\n\nWC - 1.5m x 0.9m\nwc, whb\n\nFirst Floor Landing - 2.9m x 1.1m & 1.0m x 0.7m\nCarpeted\n\nBedroom One - 3.3m x 2.6m\nCarpeted\n\nBedroom Two - 3.3m x 2.6m\nCarpeted\n\nBathroom - 2.0m x 1.63m & 0.8m x 0.5m\nLino flooring, bath, wc, whb, skylight\n\nBedroom Three - 4.8m x 3.0m\nSolid pine floor, built in wardrobes\n\nEn-Suite - 2.25m x 0.9m\nSolid pine floor, wc, whb, electric shower\n\nHotpress - 0.9m x 0.7m\nShelved\n\nBedroom Four? incl. ensuite - 5.46m x 4.3m\nCarpeted, velux, en-suite (lino flooring, ec, whb, electric shower)\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> 3 bedroom Mid Terrace house</li><li> Sea Views</li><li> Oil Fired Central Heating</li><li> Close to schools, shops and restaurants</li><li> Sea swimming at Roman Island/ The Point </li><li> Greenway can be accessed from rear of property (100 metres approx)</ul>"
